  "name": "Cassata Cake",
  "subtitle": "Layered sponge cake with ricotta, chocolate, and candied lemon",
  "description": "A chilled Italian dessert combining a light sponge, cinnamon-scented ricotta filling, rum syrup, and chocolate glaze.",
